From: artbakerchat <artbakerchat@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 21 Sep 2026 19:16:28 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] moments.json: give Bee something to actually remember

Scores give the persona the shape of your days but nothing to remember
about them. Every live run now records one line per conversation in
family/moments.json - the phrase it kept circling, or a fragment of what
was said. Keepsakes carry their notes, the diary voices (deterministic
and LLM) draw on recent memories. Live runs only; mock never records.
Local, gitignored, never a transcript.
